  toggle combination, each a fence highlighted by the code worker. The builder renders it with
  ahx_initial_only: true (the TypeScript front end example alone, the default selection); content/apphost-examples.html
  renders all of it into /_astro/apphost-examples.<build>.html, which the builder script fetches on the first
